ions that was seriously  effect affected by this flooding uh many  homes in in south korea are are  sometimes part way underground they're  semi basements and so you visited one of  those so to sort of try to reassure  people that government's doing the best  they can  bresch frank smith insole thanks so much  for bringing us that update  you
 

